    <!-- SHEET 2 -->
    <h2 class="sheet-title">Sheet: 02_BVA (Boundary Value Analysis - Rumus Wajib 4n+1)</h2>
    <p><em>Mandatory BVA Rule: Jumlah kasus uji = 4n + 1, di mana n = 3 menghasilkan 4(3) + 1 = 13 kasus uji unik dari 5n = 15 kandidat mentah (2 baris all-nominal redundan dibuang).</em></p>

    <h3 class="section-title">1. Nilai 5 Batas Tradisional (Min, Min+, Nominal, Max-, Max)</h3>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr><th>Variabel</th><th>Nama Input</th><th>Min</th><th>Min+</th><th>Nominal</th><th>Max-</th><th>Max</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><td align="center"><strong>Q1</strong></td><td>French Fries (Qty)</td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">25</td><td align="center">49</td><td align="center">50</td></tr>
            <tr><td align="center"><strong>Q2</strong></td><td>Cafe Latte (Qty)</td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">25</td><td align="center">49</td><td align="center">50</td></tr>
            <tr><td align="center"><strong>C</strong></td><td>Uang Tunai (Rp)</td><td align="center">750.000</td><td align="center">751.000</td><td align="center">1.000.000</td><td align="center">1.999.000</td><td align="center">2.000.000</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p style="font-size: 9pt; color: #475569;">*Pada kondisi nominal Q1=25, Q2=25, Total Tagihan T = (25&times;12.000) + (25&times;18.000) = Rp 750.000. Maka batas bawah pembayaran valid (Min) adalah Rp 750.000 (uang pas).</p>

